     "short_name": "Ark Bible",
     "description": "☀️The Ark Bible App is an online searchable Bible App. It offers many different versions of the Bible in many different languages. It also includes a 365 day chronological reading plan, a computer text to speech synthesizer to listen to the Bible, and a page to compare two different versions of the Bible.",
